---
// index.astro - Expo Región Estrella 2026
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>EXPO REGIÓN ESTRELLA 2026</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>⭐</text></svg>" />
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
  
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background: #020617;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding-bottom: 90px;
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .top-led-ticker {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f172a, #1e293b, #0f172a);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      color: #fbbf24;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    #starry-sky {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    header, .showcase-section, main, .trivia-section, .news-section, .contact-section, .sponsors-section, footer, .radio-player-bar, .chat-widget {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    
    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88), rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.96)), url('/imagen_aerea.jpeg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .hero-container {
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-img {
      max-width: 240px;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto 1rem auto;
      display: block;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.8));
    }
    
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
      color: #fbbf24;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .btn-glass-primary {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      color: #fef08a;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-glass-primary:hover { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45); color: #ffffff; }
    .btn-glass-secondary {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
    .btn-glass-secondary:hover { background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.35); color: #ffffff; }

    .astro-central-screen {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 48rem;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.82);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .astro-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .astro-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; }
    .astro-badge-live {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
      color: #4ade80;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .astro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .astro-card { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 0.85rem; padding: 1rem; }
    .astro-card h4 { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .astro-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #e2e8f0; line-height: 1.4; }

    .showcase-section { max-width: 76rem; margin: 2.5rem auto 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .bento-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 1.75rem; align-items: stretch; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .bento-card-video { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: 1.25rem; }
    .video-wrapper { position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 0.85rem; overflow: hidden; background: #000; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
    .video-wrapper video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

    .bento-card-info {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .bento-info-title { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .bento-info-desc { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .bento-features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .bento-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #e2e8f0; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; }

    main { flex: 1; max-width: 76rem; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.25rem; }
    .section-title h2 { font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; }
    .section-title p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; }

    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; }
    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      overflow: hidden !important;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .card-content { padding: 1.5rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
    .card-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .card-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 9999px; }
    .card-mod { font-size: 0.78rem; font-family: monospace; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.4rem; }
    .card-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .card-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .card-footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-top: 1rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn-b2b-card { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem; border-radius: 0.55rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; }

    .trivia-section { background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8) 0%, rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.95) 100%); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .trivia-container { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 2px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4); border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); text-align: center; position: relative; }
    .trivia-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding-bottom: 1rem; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .trivia-score { font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; text-align: left; flex: 1; }
    .trivia-lifelines { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .lifeline-btn { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); color: #38bdf8; padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .trivia-question-box { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9); border: 2px solid #fbbf24; border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .trivia-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .trivia-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .trivia-option-btn { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
    .trivia-option-btn.correct { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3) !important; border-color: #22c55e !important; color: #fff !important; }
    .trivia-option-btn.wrong { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3) !important; border-color: #ef4444 !important; color: #fff !important; }

    /* ESTILOS ARCADE DEFENSOR DEL FARO SPACE INVADERS */
    .minigame-overlay { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.97); z-index: 20; display: none; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .minigame-title { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .minigame-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; max-width: 34rem; }
    
    .invaders-canvas-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      height: 280px;
      background: #020617;
      border: 2px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    }
    #invadersCanvas { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; background: radial-gradient(circle at bottom, #0f172a 0%, #020617 100%); }
    
    .mg-score-badge {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #38bdf8;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
    }

    /* PANTALLA DE CELEBRACIÓN / CELEBRATION OVERLAY */
    .win-overlay {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95); } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
    .win-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 900; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6); }
    .win-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 38rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .win-badge-box { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); border: 2px solid #fbbf24; border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1rem 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fef08a; }

    .news-section { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .news-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 76rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .news-card { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
    .news-date { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .news-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.35; }
    .news-body { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .news-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 0.35rem; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 600; }

    .contact-section { background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.6); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .contact-container { max-width: 36rem; margin: 0 auto; background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .form-label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .form-input, .form-textarea { width: 100%; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #fff; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; outline: none; }
    .form-textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
    .form-status { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; }
    .form-status.success { color: #4ade80; }

    .sponsors-section { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .sponsors-group { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .sponsors-group h3 { font-size: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .logos-flex { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .sponsor-card { background: #ffffff; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.65rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); height: 70px; min-width: 130px; }
    .sponsor-logo { max-height: 50px; max-width: 140px; object-fit: contain; }

    .radio-player-bar { position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; z-index: 99; }
    .radio-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .radio-pulse { width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #22c55e; }
    .radio-title { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; }
    .radio-track { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; }
    .radio-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .radio-btn { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4); color: #fef08a; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem; }

    .chat-widget { position: fixed; bottom: 5rem; right: 1.75rem; z-index: 100; }
    .chat-btn { width: 3.5rem; height: 3.5rem; border-radius: 9999px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706); border: 2px solid #fde68a; font-size: 1.5rem; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .chat-box { display: none; position: fixed; bottom: 9rem; right: 1.75rem; width: 340px; height: 450px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); z-index: 101; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
    .chat-header { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 0.85rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
    .chat-body { flex: 1; padding: 0.85rem; overflow-y: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .chat-msg { padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 0.65rem; max-width: 85%; }
    .chat-msg.bot { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9); color: #e2e8f0; align-self: flex-start; }
    .chat-msg.user { background: #f59e0b; color: #020617; align-self: flex-end; font-weight: 600; }
    .chat-input-area { padding: 0.65rem; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .chat-input { flex: 1; background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #fff; padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.45rem; outline: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-led-ticker">
    ⭐ EXPO REGIÓN ESTRELLA 2026: Del 6 al 8 de Noviembre en Plaza Ñuñoa, Santiago. ¡Entrada Liberada! 🎟️
  </div>

  <canvas id="starry-sky"></canvas>

  <header>
    <div class="hero-container">
      <img src="/logo_oficial.jpeg" alt="EXPO REGIÓN ESTRELLA 2026" class="hero-img" onerror="this.src='/logo_muralla.jpeg'" />
      <div class="badge">📍 6 AL 8 DE NOVIEMBRE • PLAZA ÑUÑOA, SANTIAGO</div>
      <p class="hero-desc">La Región de Coquimbo se levanta y despliega lo mejor de sus valles, costas y emprendimientos.</p>
      
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="#catalogo" class="btn-glass-primary">✨ Explorar Pabellones</a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/expo-stars-4-be3ske" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-glass-secondary">📅 Agendar Cita</a>
      </div>

      <div class="astro-central-screen">
        <div class="astro-header">
          <div class="astro-title">✨ Planetario y Efemérides en Vivo • Región de Coquimbo</div>
          <div class="astro-badge-live" id="astro-time-live">Sincronizando hora Chile...</div>
        </div>
        <div class="astro-grid">
          <div class="astro-card">
            <h4>🔭 Cielos & Constelaciones</h4>
            <p id="astro-constellation">Cargando constelaciones visibles sobre Elqui, Limarí y Choapa...</p>
          </div>
          <div class="astro-card">
            <h4>🌕 Fase Lunar & Mareas</h4>
            <p id="astro-moon-tides">Calculando estado de mareas y fase lunar en la costa de Coquimbo...</p>
          </div>
          <div class="astro-card">
            <h4>⭐ Datos Expo 2026</h4>
            <p>Plaza Ñuñoa, Santiago • 6 al 8 de Noviembre. 40+ módulos de exhibición activa.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="showcase-section">
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <div class="bento-card-video">
        <div class="video-wrapper">
          <video id="promo-video" controls autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/logo_muralla.jpeg">
            <source src="/clip_promo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
            Tu navegador no soporta la reproducción de video.
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-card-info">
        <div>
          <h3 class="bento-info-title">La Gran Vitrina Regional en Santiago</h3>
          <p class="bento-info-desc">Tres días de conexión comercial directa, cultura y gastronomía tradicional en el corazón de la Región Metropolitana.</p>
          
          <div class="bento-features">
            <div class="bento-item">🏬 <strong>40+ Módulos</strong> de exhibición activa</div>
            <div class="bento-item">🏢 <strong>Inmobiliaria, Gastronomía, Minería y Turismo</strong> de Elqui, Limarí y Choapa</div>
            <div class="bento-item">📺 <strong>Transmisión en vivo</strong> vía Thema Televisión</div>
